---
/**
 * Practice, as it opens: the Today screen, drawn in the app's own ivory and
 * steel. Illustrative until Leah approves real screenshots (tracker SU-13).
 */
interface Props { class?: string; variant?: "today" | "coach" | "stear" | "close" | "proof" }
const { class: className = "", variant = "today" } = Astro.props;
---
<div class={`phone ${className}`} aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="phone-screen">
    <div class="phone-notch"></div>
    {variant === "today" && (
      <div class="px-5 pt-14 pb-6 text-[12px]">
        <p class="text-[9.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-steel">Practice</p>
        <p class="mt-1 font-display text-[21px] leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.02em]">Daily Practice Coach</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-app-muted">Bring the real moment. Leave with your next move.</p>
        <div class="mt-3 rounded-[12px] border border-app-line bg-app-surface px-3 py-2.5 text-app-faint">What's happening in your life right now?</div>
        <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
          <span class="rounded-full border border-app-line bg-app-surface px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-medium">I'm reacting right now</span>
          <span class="rounded-full border border-app-line bg-app-surface px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-medium">Help me make sense of this</span>
          <span class="rounded-full border border-app-line bg-app-surface px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-medium">A hard conversation is coming</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 rounded-[14px] bg-steel text-[#f8f5ee] p-3.5">
          <p class="text-[9.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] opacity-80">Dare of the Day</p>
          <p class="mt-1 font-display text-[15px] leading-[1.2]">Say the thing you have been rehearsing. Today. Out loud.</p>
          <div class="mt-2.5 flex items-center gap-2 text-[10.5px] font-semibold"><span class="inline-block w-4 h-4 rounded-full border-[1.5px] border-[#f8f5ee]/80"></span> I did it</div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-3 rounded-[14px] border border-app-line bg-app-surface p-3.5">
          <p class="font-semibold text-[12px]">Set up your day</p>
          <p class="text-[10.5px] text-app-muted">What would make today a win?</p>
          <div class="mt-2 inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-app-ink text-app-canvas px-3 py-1 text-[10.5px] font-semibold">Check in</div>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[9.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-app-faint">I'm reacting right now</p>
        <ul class="mt-1.5 divide-y divide-app-line rounded-[14px] border border-app-line bg-app-surface">
          <li class="flex justify-between px-3 py-2"><span>I'm about to react</span><span class="font-semibold text-steel">Pause + Redirect</span></li>
          <li class="flex justify-between px-3 py-2"><span>It's already a story</span><span class="font-semibold text-steel">Quick STEAR</span></li>
          <li class="flex justify-between px-3 py-2"><span>A feeling has me</span><span class="font-semibold text-steel">Quick RAP</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    )}
    {variant === "coach" && (
      <div class="px-4 pt-14 pb-6 text-[12px] flex flex-col h-full">
        <p class="text-[9.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-steel">Coach</p>
        <p class="mt-1 font-display text-[18px] leading-[1.1]">Daily Practice Coach</p>
        <p class="text-[9.5px] text-app-faint mt-0.5">Trained on the InnerBoard method. It is not a person.</p>
        <div class="mt-4 space-y-2.5 flex-1" data-chat>
          <div class="msg ml-auto max-w-[85%] rounded-[14px] rounded-br-[4px] bg-steel text-[#f8f5ee] px-3 py-2 text-[11px]" style="--i:0">My business partner went quiet after I sent the numbers. I keep rereading my message.</div>
          <div class="msg max-w-[90%] rounded-[14px] rounded-bl-[4px] bg-app-surface border border-app-line px-3 py-2 text-[11px] leading-snug" style="--i:1">
            Let's separate what happened from what you added. The situation: you sent the numbers, and there's been no reply yet. What are you making the silence mean?
          </div>
          <div class="msg ml-auto max-w-[85%] rounded-[14px] rounded-br-[4px] bg-steel text-[#f8f5ee] px-3 py-2 text-[11px]" style="--i:2">That I got something wrong.</div>
          <div class="msg max-w-[90%] rounded-[14px] rounded-bl-[4px] bg-app-surface border border-app-line px-3 py-2 text-[11px] leading-snug" style="--i:3">
            That's the sentence creating the feeling. Is it a fact a camera would record, or a story? Try the next rung: "I don't know yet, and I can ask."
          </div>
          <div class="typing inline-flex gap-1 rounded-[14px] bg-app-surface border border-app-line px-3 py-2" style="--i:4" aria-hidden="true"><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span></div>
          <div class="msg max-w-[90%] rounded-[14px] rounded-bl-[4px] bg-app-surface border border-app-line px-3 py-2 text-[11px] leading-snug" style="--i:5">
            Want to run that through STEAR? Two minutes, and you leave with the next move.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-3 rounded-full border border-app-line bg-app-surface px-3 py-2 text-[11px] text-app-faint flex justify-between items-center">Reply<span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-app-ink"></span></div>
      </div>
    )}
    {variant === "stear" && (
      <div class="px-5 pt-14 pb-6 text-[12px]">
        <p class="text-[9.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-steel">Tool · 2 min</p>
        <p class="mt-1 font-display text-[21px] leading-[1.1]">STEAR</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-app-muted">In the moment reset.</p>
        <ol class="mt-3 space-y-1.5">
          {[
            ["S", "Stop", "What is happening. Facts only."],
            ["T", "Think", "What story am I telling?"],
            ["E", "Emotion", "Name it. One or two words."],
            ["A", "Action", "The next right move."],
            ["R", "Reset", "What do I return to? Your standard, not your mood."]
          ].map(([l, n, h], i) => (
            <li class={`rounded-[12px] border border-app-line px-3 py-2 flex gap-3 ${i === 1 ? "bg-steel-soft" : "bg-app-surface"}`}>
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-steel text-[#f8f5ee] text-[11px] font-semibold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">{l}</span>
              <div><p class="font-semibold text-[12px]">{n}</p><p class="text-[10.5px] text-app-muted">{h}</p></div>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ol>
        <div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-[10.5px]">
          <span class="text-app-faint">Where you are now</span>
          <span class="flex gap-1">{[1,2,3,4,5].map((n) => <span class={`w-5 h-5 rounded-full border border-app-line flex items-center justify-center ${n === 4 ? "bg-app-ink text-app-canvas" : ""}`}>{n}</span>)}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    )}
    {variant === "close" && (
      <div class="px-5 pt-14 pb-6 text-[12px]">
        <p class="text-[9.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-steel">Evening · Close the day</p>
        <p class="mt-1 font-display text-[21px] leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.02em]">What did you lead today?</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-app-muted">One line. A fact, not a grade.</p>
        <div class="mt-3 rounded-[12px] border border-app-line bg-app-surface px-3 py-2.5 min-h-[64px] text-[11.5px] leading-snug">Had the conversation I had been circling since Monday. It took four minutes.</div>
        <div class="mt-3 rounded-[14px] border border-app-line bg-app-surface p-3.5">
          <p class="text-[9.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-app-faint">Today</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1.5 text-[11px]">
            <li class="flex justify-between"><span>Set up your day</span><span class="font-semibold text-steel">Done</span></li>
            <li class="flex justify-between"><span>Dare of the Day</span><span class="font-semibold text-steel">Done</span></li>
            <li class="flex justify-between"><span>STEAR · 2:14 pm</span><span class="font-semibold text-steel">Saved</span></li>
            <li class="flex justify-between"><span>Coach · 1 conversation</span><span class="text-app-faint">Kept</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-app-ink text-app-canvas px-3.5 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold">Close the day</div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[10.5px] text-app-faint">Goes into your Proof Log. 3 this week.</p>
      </div>
    )}
    {variant === "proof" && (
      <div class="px-5 pt-14 pb-6 text-[12px]">
        <p class="text-[9.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-steel">Proof Log</p>
        <p class="mt-1 font-display text-[21px] leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.02em]">A record of what you actually did.</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-app-muted">3 this week · 11 this month</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2">
          {[
            ["Tue", "Had the conversation I had been circling. Four minutes."],
            ["Mon", "Said no to the Saturday ask. Kindly, plainly."],
            ["Sun", "Sunday Set. Three priorities, two blocks held."],
            ["Fri", "Dare: asked for the referral out loud."]
          ].map(([d, t]) => (
            <li class="flex gap-3 rounded-[12px] border border-app-line bg-app-surface px-3 py-2.5">
              <span class="w-8 shrink-0 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-steel pt-0.5">{d}</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] leading-snug">{t}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <div class="mt-3 rounded-[12px] bg-steel-soft px-3 py-2.5 text-[10.5px] text-app-muted">Collected from the evening check-in, finished commitments, and every module's Proof.</div>
      </div>
    )}
  </div>
</div>
<style>
  .typing .dot { width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--color-app-faint); animation: blink 1s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .typing .dot:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 160ms; }
  .typing .dot:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 320ms; }
  @keyframes blink { 0%, 100% { opacity: 0.3; transform: translateY(0); } 50% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(-2px); } }
  .typing { position: absolute; bottom: 58px; left: 16px; }
</style>
